  "new_claims": [
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "战斗结束后，孙悟空站在倒地的战败者旁边，火星落在他肩上、臂上，也落在脚下的战败者身上；众神交头接耳议论到底是谁死了、谁活着，叙述并提问“死的真的是妖猴？”",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 47,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000047.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000047",
          "chapter_order": 47,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 1,
            "para_end": 10
          },
          "anchor": "他又一次胜利了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "孙悟空摸了摸头上，金箍还在；叙述称那是证明他是孙悟空的唯一标志。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 47,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000047.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000047",
          "chapter_order": 47,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 11,
            "para_end": 13
          },
          "anchor": "那是证明他是孙悟空的唯一标志。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "紫霞走到孙悟空面前却跪了下去，跪在倒地那只猴子身边，哭着握起那只妖猴的手并掰开它，手中是一条紫色纱巾。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 47,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000047.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000047",
          "chapter_order": 47,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 14,
            "para_end": 25
          },
          "anchor": "那手里，是一条紫色的纱巾。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "叙述交代：倒地妖猴的那只手，刚才本应拿金箍棒打中孙悟空，却伸向了紫霞。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 47,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000047.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000047",
          "chapter_order": 47,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 22,
            "para_end": 23
          },
          "anchor": "就是刚才本应拿金箍棒打中他却伸向了紫霞的那只手"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "孙悟空忽然觉得身体里什么东西裂开了，像石头崩碎，随即记起了一切，五百年前与五百年后的时光重合到一起。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 47,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000047.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000047",
          "chapter_order": 47,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 26,
            "para_end": 28
          },
          "anchor": "他突然记起了一切。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "叙述断言：西游只是一个骗局；没有人能打败孙悟空，能打败孙悟空的只有他自己；所以战胜他的唯一办法是让他怀疑自己、否认自己，把过去的一切当成罪孽、把当年的自己看成敌人，一心只要解脱与正果。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 47,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000047.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000047",
          "chapter_order": 47,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 29,
            "para_end": 32
          },
          "anchor": "西游果然只是一个骗局。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "叙述断言：在神的字典里，所谓解脱不过是死亡，所谓正果不过是幻灭，所谓成佛不过是放弃所有的爱与理想、变成一座没有灵魂的塑像。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 47,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000047.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000047",
          "chapter_order": 47,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 33,
            "para_end": 33
          },
          "anchor": "所谓成佛，不过就是放弃所有的爱与理想"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-8",
      "text": "血开始从孙悟空的七窍中流下来（叙述给出两种解释：久战震坏五脏，或他笑得太厉害）；他说“我明白了”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 47,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000047.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000047",
          "chapter_order": 47,
          "locator": {
            "para_start": 34,
            "para_end": 36
          },
          "anchor": "血开始从他的七窍中流下来"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-9",
      "text": "如来在虚空中说：当孙悟空杀死过去的自己，才终于找到了通向成佛之路；魔王孙悟空已经不复存在，以后世人只知道孙悟空成佛了，再也不会看见他。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0057/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0057"
      },
      "revealed_at": 47,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000047.txt",
